     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hi, all!</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">With the code below, I was expecting the Theta variances (adito be estimated but I only saw zeros in the output of lavInspect(fit, &#39;free&#39;)$theta, with starting values of &#39;1&#39;. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">When running lavInspect(fit, &#39;est&#39;)$theta, I get estimated values!! Is this a bug?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">ps: lavInspect(fit, &#39;cov.ov&#39;) gives unit variances to indicators as expected..<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">Hugo</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\">HS9 &lt;- HolzingerSwineford1939[,c(&quot;x1&quot;,&quot;x2&quot;,&quot;x3&quot;,&quot;x4&quot;,&quot;x5&quot;,<br>                                 &quot;x6&quot;,&quot;x7&quot;,&quot;x8&quot;,&quot;x9&quot;)]<br>HSbinary &lt;- as.data.frame( lapply(HS9, cut, 2, labels=FALSE) )<br>HS.model &lt;- &#39; visual  =~ x1 + x2 + x3<br>textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6<br>speed   =~ x7 + x8 + x9 &#39;<br><br>fit &lt;- cfa(HS.model, data=HSbinary, ordered=names(HSbinary),parameterization = &quot;delta&quot;) #with Parameterization = &quot;delta&quot; <br>lavInspect(fit, &#39;est&#39;)$theta<br>lavInspect(update(fit, parameterization = &quot;theta&quot;), &#39;est&#39;)$theta<br><br><br>lavInspect(fit, &#39;free&#39;)$theta<br>lavInspect(fit, &#39;start&#39;)$theta<br>lavInspect(fit, &#39;est&#39;)$theta<br>parTable(fit)<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-size:small\"><div><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/79f96cc75f9d/image.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"505\" height=\"500\"><br></div></div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;font-size:medium\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"10\"><p style=\"margin-right:10px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><a href=\"http://www.adaptativa.com.br/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.adaptativa.com.br/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422750669000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3aJN5jeXXETdSD5_8z_iyV\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FE2I4wjFnN2cAFKRmI3TKMszOlSp21wnNu4SqBeCJZBTRvT_FvrlgmwCaxvFTesKdXjysxxb7nvH4if6T_hi884vh3N59BHtgm3-wqx9bgkcnTo-Jw1Bg01c1Tk3qGCKYDUC3lEyIIXfgYCyCshNyEk3Ee8Wg4ibOcS9FfxhtyTI=s0-d-e1-ft#https://htmlsigs.s3.amazonaws.com/logos/files/000/177/391/landscape/adaptativa_256px80pxL_72dpi_SEM_SLOGAN.jpg\" alt=\"Adaptativa\" border=\"0\" height=\"62\" width=\"200\"></a></p></td><td align=\"left\"><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:14px;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;display:inline\">Hugo Harada</span><span style=\"display:inline\"><br></span>Sócio-fundador - COO</font><span style=\"font-size:12px\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:14px\"><